# Every .env variant is ignored, then the committed templates are allowed back
# in by name. DEPLOYMENT.md has you create .env.production and .env.staging on
# the VPS inside this checkout — real secrets sitting in the working tree — so
# the default has to be "ignored" rather than a list of known filenames.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
!.env.staging.example
!.env.branch.example

